The plugin connection design (token handshake, close codes 4001/4002/4009, one
connected plugin, a panel that reconnects and remembers its port and token)
follows the InDesign UXP bridge in packages/indesign/uxp, which was adapted
from https://github.com/theloniuser/indesign-uxp-server (author: theloniuser).

tests/fixtures/premiere-uxp-api.json lists class, member and constant names
from Adobe's UXP for Premiere reference (https://github.com/AdobeDocs/uxp-premiere-pro,
Apache-2.0). Names only; no documentation text is included.
